---
permalink: /
layout: default
---
<div class="wrapper">
  <section class="intro">
    <h1 class="intro__title">Hi, I'm {{ site.author }}</h1>
    <div class="intro__tagline">
      <p>
        Thanks for dropping by! I&rsquo;m a Data Engineer, Rustacean, and curious developer who writes
        about technology, coding, and architecture here&mdash;think of it as my public notebook. Read more
        <a href="/about-me/">about me</a>, or subscribe via <a href="/newsletter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">newsletter</a>
        or <a href="/feed.xml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RSS</a> to stay updated.
      </p>
    </div>
    {%- comment -%}
      An 8-petal rangoli-style lotus sitting on the divider below the intro, right-aligned — radial
      symmetry and the dot accents at each petal tip are the two hallmarks of rangoli floral motifs.
      One petal path is defined once and reused via <use> with rotation, rather than hand-authoring
      all eight, so the symmetry is exact. Kept as thin outlines (not filled) plus small solid dots —
      the dots are traditionally solid in rangoli work — to stay within the site's monochrome,
      line-art icon language rather than introducing a new illustration style.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="intro__ornament" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <path id="rangoli-petal" d="M24 24 C 20.8 17.5, 20.8 10, 24 5.5 C 27.2 10, 27.2 17.5, 24 24 Z"/>
      </defs>
      <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <use href="#rangoli-petal"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(45 24 24)"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(90 24 24)"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(135 24 24)"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(180 24 24)"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(225 24 24)"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(270 24 24)"/>
        <use href="#rangoli-petal" transform="rotate(315 24 24)"/>
      </g>
      <g fill="currentColor">
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(45 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(90 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(135 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(180 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(225 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(270 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="5.5" r="1" transform="rotate(315 24 24)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="2.25"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </section>
  {%- if collections.featuredPosts.size > 0 -%}
  <section class="recent-posts">
    <div class="recent-posts__header">
      <h2>Featured Posts</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      {%- for post in collections.featuredPosts -%}
        {% include "components/post-preview.liquid" %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}
  <section class="recent-posts">
    <div class="recent-posts__header">
      <h2>Recent Posts</h2>
      <a href="/blog/">View all &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      {%- assign recentPosts = collections.recentPosts | limit: 9 -%}
      {%- for post in recentPosts -%}
        {% include "components/post-preview.liquid" %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
